{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-comares-frames",
  "title": "Framed stars of the Salón de Comares (Alhambra)",
  "fold": 4,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "level": "advanced",
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data174/SPA1416: Alhambra, Salón de Comares",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data174/SPA1416.html",
      "note": "The design was read from his line drawing; the construction (one star circle, its frame and the diamonds found from the star’s own corners) is ours."
    },
    {
      "source": "Photograph SPA 1416 (zellige, Salón de Comares)",
      "creator": "David Wade",
      "url": "https://patterninislamicart.com/",
      "note": "The real panel, used to check the wall."
    }
  ],
  "given": {"O": "The centre of a framed star.", "A": "Halfway from O to the next framed star."},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through O and A and draw a circle about O through A. A framed star sits at O and at every grid point two radii away, and a plain star at each corner of the cell.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through O. At the four points where the circle meets the two lines, rule lines at right angles to them: the square cell. Rule its two diagonals through O.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "P90": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "P180": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "P270": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "gx": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gxw": {"line": {"through": "P180", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "P90", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "gys": {"line": {"through": "P270", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "K": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gy"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gxw", "gys"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gx", "gys"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": ["O", "K2"]}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mark where the diagonal crosses the circle, at D, and drop a vertical from D to the horizontal, at E. Draw the circle about A through E, and the circle about O with the same radius: it is the circle of the stars, and it crosses the horizontal at T, the star’s point.",
      "create": {
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "dv": {"line": {"through": "D", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["dv", "h"]}},
        "cs": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "radiusFrom": ["E", "A"]}},
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The star is two squares in this circle. One has its corners on the horizontal and vertical: through T rule the two lines at 45°. The other has its corners on the diagonals: where the circle meets the diagonal, at Q, rule a vertical and a horizontal.",
      "create": {
        "e1": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "e2": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "d45"}},
        "Q": {"point": {"meet": ["cs", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "x1": {"line": {"through": "Q", "parallelTo": "v"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["cs"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The vertical through Q meets the 45° line through T at V, an inner corner of the star. Rule the horizontal through V; it meets the other line through T at F. The vertical through F is a side of the star’s frame.",
      "create": {
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["x1", "e1"]}},
        "vh": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "F": {"point": {"meet": ["vh", "e2"]}},
        "fr": {"line": {"through": "F", "parallelTo": "v"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["Q", "T"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The stars at the corners of the cell, and the next framed stars, have the same lines. Drop Q onto the horizontal; open the compass from O to that foot and mark the distance either side of A, and carry T across A. The verticals and slanting lines through the marks belong to those stars.",
      "create": {
        "Qh": {"point": {"meet": ["x1", "h"]}},
        "cq": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusFrom": ["O", "Qh"]}},
        "Q1": {"point": {"meet": ["cq", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "Q2": {"point": {"meet": ["cq", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "x2": {"line": {"through": "Q1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "x3": {"line": {"through": "Q2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "ct": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "through": "T"}},
        "T2": {"point": {"meet": ["ct", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "e3": {"line": {"through": "T2", "parallelTo": "d135"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["A"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "A small diamond sits on each side of the cell. Open the compass from V to T and mark that distance either side of A: the diamond’s corners. Through them rule the lines at 45°.",
      "create": {
        "cc": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusFrom": ["V", "T"]}},
        "G1": {"point": {"meet": ["cc", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "G2": {"point": {"meet": ["cc", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "g1": {"line": {"through": "G1", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "g2": {"line": {"through": "G2", "parallelTo": "d135"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["V", "T"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Turn all these lines about O by quarter turns, so the cell has them on every side.",
      "create": {
        "cp": {"repeat": {"of": ["e1", "e2", "x1", "fr", "x2", "x3", "e3", "g1", "g2"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
